# Academy testing

- Unit/integration: Vitest for domain services and permission fail-closed paths.
- RLS: automated tests that switch DB roles / session claims and assert deny-by-default.
- E2E a11y: Playwright + axe-core on the vertical slice (catalogue → learn → quiz → certificate).
- Fixtures use fictional workers and organisations only.
- Assert attempted answer mutation after submit fails; immutable CourseVersion after publish/complete.
